[h1]multiplayer-undo[/h1]
Rewind combat together in Slay the Spire 2. Choose an earlier point from the action history or restart the current fight, while keeping the multiplayer room and connections.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]During combat, press [b]Left Arrow[/b] to open the history window.
[*]Choose an earlier point, or select [b]Restart Combat[/b].
[*]In multiplayer, the proposer automatically agrees. Every other player must accept before undo starts.
[*]You do not need to wait for current actions to finish. The history window stays open when another player acts.
[*]After replay finishes for everyone, continue playing from the restored point.
[/list]

[h2]v0.1.12[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixes undo getting stuck after everyone accepts when a player has ended their turn.
[*]Undo no longer waits for players to become able to act or for the old action queues to become idle.
[*]Keeps the history window open across other players' actions.
[*]Preserves the existing multiplayer session and compares everyone's restored results after replay.
[/list]

[h2]Before playing[/h2]
[list]
[*]Every participant must enable the mod, update to [b]v0.1.12[/b], and restart the game.
[*]History is kept in memory and is not saved between game sessions.
[*]Repeated undo has been tested in local 3- and 4-player ENet sessions, including different replay speeds. This is local test coverage, not verification of Steam P2P across separate computers.
[/list]

[h2]Languages[/h2]
English, Korean, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese. Each player sees the UI in their own game language. Other languages use English.

[h2]한국어[/h2]
전투 중 [b]왼쪽 방향키[/b]를 눌러 히스토리를 열고, 원하는 시점이나 [b]전투 처음부터[/b]를 선택하세요. 제안자는 자동 동의하며, 나머지 전원이 수락하면 되돌립니다. 현재 행동이 끝나길 기다릴 필요가 없고, 다른 플레이어가 행동해도 선택창은 유지됩니다. 기존 멀티 방을 유지하며 복원 후 결과를 확인합니다. 모든 참가자가 [b]v0.1.12[/b]로 업데이트한 뒤 게임을 다시 실행해야 합니다.

[h2]简体中文[/h2]
战斗中按[b]左方向键[/b]打开历史，选择要回退的时点，或选择[b]重新开始战斗[/b]。提议者自动同意，其余玩家全部接受后开始回退。无需等待当前行动结束，其他玩家行动时历史窗口也会保持打开。回退保留现有多人房间，并在重放后检查恢复结果。所有玩家均须更新至[b]v0.1.12[/b]并重启游戏。

[h2]繁體中文[/h2]
戰鬥中按[b]左方向鍵[/b]開啟歷史，選擇要回溯的時間點，或選擇[b]重新開始戰鬥[/b]。提議者自動同意，其餘玩家全部接受後開始回溯。無須等待目前行動結束，其他玩家行動時歷史視窗也會保持開啟。回溯保留既有多人房間，並在重播後檢查還原結果。所有玩家均須更新至[b]v0.1.12[/b]並重新啟動遊戲。

